    "tool.compound-interest-calc.desc": "Free compound interest calculator: enter principal, annual rate, years and compounding frequency (daily, monthly, quarterly, annual), plus an optional monthly contribution, to get your final balance, total contributions and total interest — with a year-by-year growth table. No login, no ads, computed in your browser.",
