    "tool.hours-calc.name": "Hours Calculator",
    "tool.hours-calc.use": "How many hours between two times? Enter a start and end time to get the duration in hours and minutes plus decimal hours — an overnight shift rolls to the next day automatically and an unpaid break gets subtracted. Need to add or subtract time instead? Switch tabs.",
