    "guide.heading": "About Toolhub",
    "guide.lead": "Toolhub is a growing collection of free web tools for the small calculations and conversions that come up in everyday life — from checking which pack is cheaper to counting the characters in an essay. Every tool runs the moment you open it: no installs, no accounts, no waiting.",
    "guide.useTitle": "Finding the right tool",
    "guide.useBody": "Browse the directory above, grouped into categories like Finance & Shopping, Health & Body, Units & Conversion, Date & Time and Developer Tools. In a hurry? Type a keyword into the search box — \"unit price\", \"BMI\", \"timer\" — and the list filters as you type. Tap any tool to open it on its own page, and switch the whole site to any of 14 languages from the header.",
    "guide.howTitle": "Private by design",
    "guide.howBody": "Every Toolhub tool is a pure static page: whatever you type is processed entirely inside your own browser and is never uploaded to a server. There are no sign-ups and no numbers to hand over, so you can work out a salary, a loan or a private bill with peace of mind. Your theme and language choices are the only things saved, and they stay in this browser's local storage.",
    "guide.tipTitle": "Free, and always growing",
    "guide.tipBody": "All tools are completely free, with no subscriptions or hidden fees. New tools are added regularly and appear on this page the moment they launch, so it is worth bookmarking. If a tool you need is missing, chances are it is already on the way.",
